ction><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span><span>住宿保障</span></span></strong></em><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>免费为在读学生提供双人或四人间的住宿保障，具体由华大各片区培养单位安排。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span><span>学生福利</span></span></strong></em><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>华大为同学们提供更多的学生福利保障，如团建活动基金、交通补助、每年一次价值约一万元的高端体检、各大节日福利礼品、课题组的科研奖励等。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span><span>商业保险</span></span></strong></em><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为了给华大专项的同学们提供更全面的医疗保障，华大还为同学们额外提供一份商业保险，可享受意外、门急诊医疗、住院医疗等保险保障。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><em><strong><span>（最终标准以各体系片区及当年入学实际情况为准）</span></strong></em></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>· 中国科学院大学华大专项硕博研究生学费标准请参考中国科学院大学统一学费标准，详见</span><span><span>中国科学院大学招生信息网：https://admission.ucas.ac.cn/。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span>· 如有与国家或中国科学院